3. **the static sibling** (`proof/%%STATIC%%`), when neither of the two above says anything — the beat then reads in
   the language its own family already reads in.

Nothing here is guessed from the data, the source or the subject. A request in one language beside a profile in
another is NOT a contradiction to resolve by taste: the request wins, and the line below says so out loud.

